    "让 Mac 在长时间任务中保持唤醒——下载、渲染、演示都不再被打断。": {
      "comment": "",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让 Mac 在长时间任务中保持唤醒——下载、渲染、演示都不再被打断。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep your Mac awake through long tasks — downloads, renders, and presentations no longer get interrupted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
